{
  "$schema": "../gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json",
  "identifier": "app",
  "description": "The app window: core defaults (events, window getters, path, app info), its own window controls, the opener plugin limited to http / https / mailto / slack URLs (the docs URL included) and paths under the home folder, the logs folder and the data folder (08 §5.3), notification and os plugins, every app command: sessions and session detail, history, snooze, files and diff, transcript, hooks, settings, health, the notes commands, the PTY host (terminal, launch, resume, prompt, quit), the package 9 settings / diagnostics / stats / secrets commands, the connectors commands (accounts and sign-in, sources, the Inbox, important people, the calendar, alerts, alert rules and quiet hours, the AI backends), package 11: Chat (with the core's file picker), Automations, theme packs and the command palette, and dictation (XC-37, XC-38: status, press / release / cancel, dictation_inserted, the model catalog and downloads, the microphone check, app_context_set; dictation_say, which only a dev build routes, 08 §12), the Now playing commands (OV-37) and the opener for the macOS Automation privacy pane (Settings → Overlay, Now playing). No overlay geometry: the core moves the overlay. No dialog plugin grant: the core shows the pickers.",
  "windows": [
    "app"
  ],
  "permissions": [
    "core:default",
    "core:window:allow-show",
    "core:window:allow-hide",
    "core:window:allow-close",
    "core:window:allow-minimize",
    "core:window:allow-maximize",
